  - `[0.6, 0.2, 0.2]`
  - `[0.5, 0.25, 0.25]`
  - `[0.4, 0.4, 0.2]`
- Pick the best holdout RMSLE blend.
This gives most of the ensemble gain with almost no implementation risk.

